message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "IPMAI Cycle Monitor"
version: 1.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23477373
authors:
  - given-names: Ivo
    family-names: Bukovsky
    affiliation: "Department of Computer Science, Faculty of Science, University of South Bohemia in České Budějovice; CELS - Center for Explainable Learning Systems"
abstract: >-
  Python software suite for simulation and monitoring of cyclic and dynamical
  systems, including PID Cycle Monitor, Robotic Cycle Monitor, and Harmonic
  Drive Cycle Monitor. The software supports feature extraction, Linear Neural
  Unit modelling, Learning Entropy, saliency analysis, PCA, and classification.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/CELS-USB/IPMAI-SW-WP2"
keywords:
  - explainable machine learning
  - prescriptive maintenance
  - cyclic systems
  - learning entropy
  - robotic monitoring
